    "answerText": "Summary\nIf you configure and assign a Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to the user, Teams checks the userΓÇÖs outgoing calls against the Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to determine whether their dialed number matches a number-pattern that you've defined in the online voice-routing policy.\n\nIf you configure and assign a Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to the user, Teams checks the userΓÇÖs outgoing calls against the Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to determine whether their dialed number matches a number-pattern that you've defined in the online voice-routing policy.\n\nIf you configure and assign a Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to the user, Teams checks the userΓÇÖs outgoing calls against the Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to determine whether their dialed number matches a number-pattern that you've defined in the online voice-routing policy.\n\nIf you configure and assign a Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to the user, Teams checks the userΓÇÖs outgoing calls against the Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to determine whether their dialed number matches a number-pattern that you've defined in the online voice-routing policy.\n\nFor more information, see Direct Routing voice routing policy considerations.\n\nUnsupported gaps\nNot established from available authoritative evidence (mandatory:entity:csv-export:output-transformation): The Teams-side data retrieval for this workflow is authoritatively covered where supported; CSV export is a generic PowerShell step not currently covered by Relay's authoritative corpus.\n\nNot established from available authoritative evidence (missing_authority): The Teams-side data retrieval for this workflow is authoritatively covered where supported; CSV export is a generic PowerShell step not currently covered by Relay's authoritative corpus.\n\nCaveats / limitations\nOnly supported portions should be answered.\n\nMissing autho